      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "B7.06.3.S03",
      "skills": [
        "book.words",
        "vocab.meaning"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "Homophones: ऐसे शब्द जो एक जैसे बोले जाते हैं पर मतलब अलग है। tail (पूँछ) – tale (कहानी), see (देखना) – sea (समुद्र), hole (छेद) – whole (पूरा), write (लिखना) – right (सही), I (मैं) – eye (आँख)।",
        "hinglish": "Homophones: aise shabd jo ek jaise bole jaate hain par matlab alag hai. tail (poonchh) – tale (kahani), see (dekhna) – sea (samudra), hole (chhed) – whole (poora), write (likhna) – right (sahi), I (main) – eye (aankh).",
        "en": "Homophones sound the same but mean different things: tail – tale, see – sea, hole – whole, write – right, I – eye."
      }
    },
